            0.791
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "There are at least two ways of finding the point D —"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.209,
            0.794,
            0.884,
            0.837
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "One uses the fact that all the angles of a rectangle are right angles."
            }
          ]
        },
